{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T18:12:35.108Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Supplement Guides Library | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216192983627","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Free downloadable guides for supplement brand entrepreneurs. The Definitive Guide, Ingredients and Testing Guide, Client Onboarding Guide.","name":"Private Label - Page - Guides Library","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-guides","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:42:20.777Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-guides","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_HeroBackground_2.jpg') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">GUIDES</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Free guides for supplement brand entrepreneurs.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Tactical, downloadable guides covering everything from initial launch to scaling and expansion. All free, all written by our team.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Browse All Resources</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608985,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Three foundational guides every supplement brand should read.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most supplement entrepreneurs spend weeks or months figuring out the basics of private label, ingredient sourcing, and onboarding. We wrote these three guides to compress that learning curve.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216201608986,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M12 6.04A8.97 8.97 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.05 0-2.06.18-3 .51v14.25A8.99 8.99 0 0 1 6 18c2.3 0 4.4.87 6 2.29m0-14.25a8.97 8.97 0 0 1 6-2.29c1.05 0 2.06.18 3 .51v14.25A8.99 8.99 0 0 0 18 18a8.97 8.97 0 0 0-6 2.29m0-14.25v14.25\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">The Definitive Guide to Private Label Supplements</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">50+ pages covering every step from initial idea to product launch. Costs, regulations, timelines, and tactical advice. The most-downloaded guide in our library.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M9.75 3.1v5.66m4.5-5.66v5.66m-4.5 0a3.38 3.38 0 0 1-1.5 6.43m6-6.43a3.38 3.38 0 0 0 1.5 6.43M4.5 19.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5 4.5h6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 4.5-4.5v-4.31a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5-4.5h-6a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-4.5 4.5v4.31Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Ingredients, Testing & Certification Guide</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Deep-dive into how supplement quality is built from raw material to finished product. Sourcing, testing protocols, certifications explained.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M4.26 10.15a23.93 23.93 0 0 1 14.66-.36c.41.12.69.5.69.93v6.91a2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55 2.39 23.94 23.94 0 0 0-12.94 0 2.62 2.62 0 0 1-1.55-2.39v-6.92c0-.42.27-.8.69-.93Z\"/><path d=\"M4.26 10.15A23.93 23.93 0 0 1 12 9c1.05 0 2.08.1 3.07.31M4.26 10.15c-.85.46-1.7.98-2.51 1.55a25 25 0 0 0 10.25 5.32\"/><path d=\"M18.75 11.25v-2.4l3-1.62-7.5-4.23-7.5 4.23 3 1.62v2.4\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Client Onboarding Guide</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Week-by-week timeline of what to expect during your first 90 days as a private label client. Decisions, milestones, and how to set up for a smooth launch.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608987,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your private label supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608988,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032302,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":4,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608990,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are these guides updated regularly?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Major guides are refreshed annually. We update them when regulatory landscape shifts or when supplement industry trends warrant it. Each guide shows its last-updated date so you know what you're getting.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Which guide should I download first?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">If you're exploring private label generally: Definitive Guide. If you've decided private label is right and want to understand quality: Ingredients & Testing. If you've signed and are launching: Onboarding Guide. They build on each other but each stands alone.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I print these to read offline?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. They're delivered as PDFs designed for both screen reading and print. Many clients print them and mark them up during their evaluation process.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Do you have any video guides or webinars?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">We host occasional webinars on specific topics (FDA compliance updates, category trends). Recordings are available on request. Our written guides go deeper than what we cover in webinar format.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Where can I suggest a topic for a future guide?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Email any feedback or topic requests to info@davincilabs.com. We genuinely look at every suggestion and several past guides started as client requests.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216201608991,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950233523,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":7,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}